{"type":"assistant","uuid":"01a1b698-3fa2-7bf6-aed2-d74ae98db859","session_id":"01a1b694-bf86-79ef-9b9d-323d8d10c8a2","message":{"id":"01a1b6983fa27bf6aed2d7486a559fdb","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"These look consistent with design §5. Let me verify renderCi output equals ci.yml byte-for-byte with a read-only pure-function check. I can import renderCi and compare — that's a read-only pure function (no file writes). But importing gen-ci.mjs has a `main()` guarded by `invokedDirectly`, so importing won't write. Good. Let me run that check via node -e (read-only).\n\nActually let me hold and batch all pure-function checks later.\n\nNow let me read check-traceability.mjs, milestone-gate.mjs, check-defects.mjs, ac-index.json, package.json, package-lock.json, T-001.json.","signature":""}],"model":"hy4","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b694c37777a89e7b949da7c8c488","_messageId":"01a1b6983fa27bf6aed2d7486a559fdb","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b694c37777a89e7b949da7c8c488","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b6983fa27bf6aed2d7486a559fdb","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b6983fa27bf6aed2d7486a559fdb","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a1b698-3fa2-7bf6-aed2-d74ae98db859","traceparent":"00-f2afc752a8a37e0cd10f85162fee58ac-07ea269c5c5feea8-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b694-bf86-79ef-9b9d-323d8d10c8a2,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b694c37777a89e7b949da7c8c488"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T15:19:57.673Z"}
