{"type":"assistant","uuid":"01a1b698-6628-7fef-9177-43a0905dee51","session_id":"01a1b694-bf86-79ef-9b9d-323d8d10c8a2","message":{"id":"01a1b69866287fef9177439e4cb2a855","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"These look compliant. Let me note a potential issue with `checkDefects` default mode: A74-04 expects `m4-nocache` default to fail with `defects.missing_fixed a5-nocache`. The code requires `merged.acs[item.ac] === 'covered'`. In m4-nocache fixture, AC-055 is covered → a5-nocache required → no [fixed] → error. ✓\n\nFor m2-planned default: AC-026 planned → a5-shell not required → pass. ✓\n\n`--milestone M5` set_mismatch ✓. `M9` → exit 2 ✓ (regex). Gate missing milestone → exit 2 ✓.\n\nGate step 4: only runs full test if no errors ✓. Uses `--out-dir mkdtemp` ✓. Checks `gate.file_not_executed` ✓. Deletes dir ✓.\n\nHmm — one thing: design §8.3 says gate step 3 passes `checkDefects({ milestone: Mx })` errors with `defects.*` ids \"原样输出（标识保留 defects.*）\". Code does `errors.push(...checkDefects({...}).errors)` — keeps ids ✓.\n\nNow let me read the data files: ac-index.json, package.json, package-lock.json, T-001.json, a3-runner.test.mjs, and the self-tests. Also check `.collab` absence and encoding. Let me batch several reads plus some read-only script checks.","signature":""}],"model":"hy4","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b694c37777a89e7b949da7c8c488","_messageId":"01a1b69866287fef9177439e4cb2a855","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b694c37777a89e7b949da7c8c488","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b69866287fef9177439e4cb2a855","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b69866287fef9177439e4cb2a855","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a1b698-6628-7fef-9177-43a0905dee51","traceparent":"00-f2afc752a8a37e0cd10f85