ies (mode, name, sha), for each blob compute worktree file's git blob hash and compare. This handles \"被评审代码与 HEAD 内容一致\". Also detect untracked files (files in worktree not in tree). This replaces git status.\n\nLet me write a node script for this. Need zlib for reading objects. Tree object parsing: binary format: \"mode name\\0\" + 20-byte sha. Let me implement.\n\nAlso note: there might be packed objects (not loose). Let me check .git/objects for loose tree. If not found, need to handle packs — that's harder. Let me check.\n\nAlso need `.git/config` for autocrlf. Let me check.\n\nLet me batch these checks.","signature":""}],"model":"hy4","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b694c37777a89e7b949da7c8c488","_messageId":"01a1b699350078fc8e74fca0c4543ff5","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b694c37777a89e7b949da7c8c488","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b699350078fc8e74fca0c4543ff5","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b699350078fc8e74fca0c4543ff5","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a1b699-3500-78fc-8e74-fca28327b728","traceparent":"00-f2afc752a8a37e0cd10f85162fee58ac-07ea269c5c5feea8-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b694-bf86-79ef-9b9d-323d8d10c8a2,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b694c37777a89e7b949da7c8c488"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T15:21:33.783Z"}
