e. I'll keep the 47-row table.\n\nOne more check: \"verdict 必须写明 so 验证的 git sha、通过数/总数、以及每条结论的证据（命令输出或文件行号）\". So verdict.json must have:\n- sha ✓\n- passed/total ✓\n- evidence per conclusion → the `checks[]` array with per-item evidence ✓\n- Also top-level evidence[] array ✓\n\nGood.\n\nLet me write.","signature":""}],"model":"hy4","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b694c37777a89e7b949da7c8c488","_messageId":"01a1b69e966e7499ae667769a32e6971","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b694c37777a89e7b949da7c8c488","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b69e966e7499ae667769a32e6971","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b69e966e7499ae667769a32e6971","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a1b69e-966e-7499-ae66-776b1e19d9e5","traceparent":"00-f2afc752a8a37e0cd10f85162fee58ac-07ea269c5c5feea8-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b694-bf86-79ef-9b9d-323d8d10c8a2,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b694c37777a89e7b949da7c8c488"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T15:27:54.767Z"}
